Source systems (read-only snapshots under sources/, ported into
product/):

  mneme        — https://github.com/annatchijova/mneme
                 per-memory custody chains, authority provenance,
                 recall receipts, decisions, claims, counterfactual
                 worlds, sealed bundles, offline verification.
                 The forensic core the product runs on.

  raven-memory — https://github.com/annatchijova/raven-memory
                 adaptive field dynamics (reinforcement, inhibition,
                 forgetting, rescue) — the mechanics the experiments
                 amputated and the field semantics mneme implements.

  stigmergy    — https://github.com/annatchijova/stigmergy
                 shared-memory coordination substrate; source of the
                 reinforcement closed form c' = c + alpha(1-c).

Method / tooling corpus:

  SKILLS       — https://github.com/annatchijova/SKILLS
                 the skill corpus used during development —
                 abductive reasoning, adversarial audit, invariant
                 hunting, falsifiable testing, tamper-evident chains,
                 deterministic-core discipline. The audits in this
                 repository ran through those skills.

Runtime:

  Nebius Token Factory — LLM + embeddings backend
    (nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B chat,
     Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-8B embeddings).

Everything in this repository is research material. The claims it
makes are experimental results on synthetic fields — not production
guarantees.
